# The executable configuration now has one source: deploy/auth/nginx.conf.template.
# Render it with scripts/prepare_auth.py (docs/AUTH_DEPLOYMENT.md) and use
# compose.auth.yaml. Do not include this file inside an existing http/server block.
# Generated configuration is a full nginx.conf, with separate internal Bearer and
# browser-session verifiers, public resource metadata, and no secret-bearing logs.
